WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.840
People ask me this all the time.

2
00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:03.080
The short answer is no.

3
00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:05.600
If you stayed in the same 
Domoee home for decades,

4
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.040
you could look at it that way.

5
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.640
But that's not really what 
makes Domoee different.

6
00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:10.880
Life changes.

7
00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:14.320
Families grow, jobs move,
 and circumstances shift.

8
00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:17.920
But with Domoee, you're not tied to one
 property for the rest of your life.

9
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.160
If you want to move to 
another Domoee home later,

10
00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:24.040
you can transfer the value you've 
built instead of starting all over again.

11
00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:26.240
And that's what makes it 
fundamentally different.